  "description": "Born under the Star of Darkness, Princess Baekseon always knew she was fated for something big, but it’s only after she disguises herself as a boy and leaves the safety of the palace that she begins to see just how big. Malicious old hags, cheerful goblins, lovesick witches, and the promise of a mysterious soulmate with red and blue eyes are just the beginning: ultimately, what hangs in the balance is the fate of the world itself. \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
